# Dog Vision Hardware Architecture & Components

## Overview
This document outlines the hardware and architectural components needed for a prototype device that reads smell intensity and visualizes it by modifying the blue color channel on a display.

## System Architecture
- VOC sensor array (electronic nose)
- Microcontroller (ESP32 / Arduino / Raspberry Pi)
- Communication (USB, BLE, Wi-Fi)
- Display host

## Hardware
- MQ or MEMS VOC sensors
- ESP32 controller
- Power module
- Enclosure / scanning rod

## Notes
Sensor outputs are normalized and sent to the host for visualization.
